00:21:10.687 --> 00:21:11.729
Hey.

00:21:11.729 --> 00:21:14.065
I saw what you did for that guy.

00:21:14.065 --> 00:21:15.274
It was really sweet.

00:21:15.274 --> 00:21:16.275
Oh...

00:21:16.275 --> 00:21:17.735
Do you want a dance?

00:21:17.735 --> 00:21:19.904
Uh, no, thanks.

00:21:19.904 --> 00:21:21.405
Do you want some yams?

00:21:21.405 --> 00:21:23.449
No, thanks.

00:21:23.449 --> 00:21:24.450
I'm Amber.

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:26.036
I'm Ted.

00:21:26.036 --> 00:21:29.080
Actually... I'm Tracy.

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:31.582
Still Ted.

00:21:31.582 --> 00:21:35.545
<i>And that, kids, is the true</i>

00:21:31.582 --> 00:21:35.545
<i>story of how I met your mother.</i>

